 the total derivative of $y$ with respect to $x$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix.\n\nTherefore, the product\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\n$$\n\nof a $2\\times 2$ matrix with a $2\\times 4$ matrix is a $2\\times 4$ matrix." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-97c12cb8-5725-50f2-aa29-32cc8b67a848" "answer-field-f3e88de5-3537-5d05-b414-2095d1fba253" "answer-field-a058cc13-5200-5985-ace8-aa6e1663852a" "answer-field-1a17a647-d699-507a-84b6-ca789a2ab305" "answer-field-3b9e8840-aaa6-5d7d-9128-b8163c8808ca" "answer-field-d909fbcb-d827-5b40-9359-4b2948795876"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-97c12cb8-5725-50f2-aa29-32cc8b67a848" :answer-field/id #uuid "97c12cb8-5725-50f2-aa29-32cc8b67a848" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-f8b053af-73e3-5382-bd96-6c77018b08b6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f8b053af-73e3-5382-bd96-6c77018b08b6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f8b053af-73e3-5382-bd96-6c77018b08b6" :answer/id #uuid "f8b053af-73e3-5382-bd96-6c77018b08b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f3e88de5-3537-5d05-b414-2095d1fba253" :answer-field/id #uuid "f3e88de5-3537-5d05-b414-2095d1fba253" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-b820369c-81ff-58ee-a127-e2d6233a0b94" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b820369c-81ff-58ee-a127-e2d6233a0b94"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b820369c-81ff-58ee-a127-e2d6233a0b94" :answer/id #uuid "b820369c-81ff-58ee-a127-e2d6233a0b94" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a058cc13-5200-5985-ace8-aa6e1663852a" :answer-field/id #uuid "a058cc13-5200-5985-ace8-aa6e1663852a" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :a