 {{field-6}} \nmatrix."] ["question-cfa20750-c86e-5358-ae72-96466e6a1578" :question/worked-solution "Using the chain rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}f(y(x))=\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\nLet's consider each of the factors in turn.\n\n- The function $f$ acts on a vector $y\\in {R}^{2}$ and outputs a vector $f(y)\\in {R}^{2}.$ Thus, the total derivative of $f$ with respect to $y$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\n- The function $y$ acts on a vector $x\\in {R}^{4}$ and outputs a vector $y(x)\\in {R}^{2}.$ Thus, the total derivative of $y$ with respect to $x$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix.\n\nTherefore, the product\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\n$$\n\nof a $2\\times 2$ matrix with a $2\\times 4$ matrix is a $2\\times 4$ matrix."] ["question-cfa20750-c86e-5358-ae72-96466e6a1578" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-10b9c40d-0f99-5165-992c-7ee67c9fdf0b" :answer-field/id #uuid "10b9c40d-0f99-5165-992c-7ee67c9fdf0b"] ["answer-0d226b16-1f62-526c-ace4-04ab4e5f0015" :answer/id #uuid "0d226b16-1f62-526c-ace4-04ab4e5f0015"] ["answer-0d226b16-1f62-526c-ace4-04ab4e5f0015" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0d226b16-1f62-526c-ace4-04ab4e5f0015" :answer/value "2"] ["answer-field-10b9c40d-0f99-5165-992c-7ee67c9fdf0b" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-10b9c40d-0f99-5165-992c-7ee67c9fdf0b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-10b9c40d-0f99-5165-992c-7ee67c9fdf0b" :answer-field/correct "answer-0d226b16-1f62-526c-ace4-04ab4e5f0015"] ["answer-field-10b9c40d-0f99-5165-992c-7ee67c9fdf0b" :answer-field/choices "answer-0d226b16-1f62-526c-ace4-04ab4e5f0015"] ["answer-field-06a730cb-f6f9-509a-b61c-4cd84171ee45" :answer-field/id #uuid "06a730cb-f6f9-509a-b61c-4cd84171ee45"] ["answer-6a342a32-6392-5dbb-a213-057659b94404" :answer/id #uuid "6a342a32-6392-5dbb-a213-057659b94404"] ["answer-6a342a32-6392-5dbb-