answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-e28c09c1-aa3c-5844-9e63-e8909dfcd99f" :answer-field/correct "answer-3bad7d77-5b3b-5af2-8a59-8f057e347751"] ["answer-field-e28c09c1-aa3c-5844-9e63-e8909dfcd99f" :answer-field/choices "answer-3bad7d77-5b3b-5af2-8a59-8f057e347751"] ["question-78eabbdb-ae14-5218-80c9-de54367d95a9" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-0c22a089-927d-5420-ba5b-9d5a307d76f3"] ["question-78eabbdb-ae14-5218-80c9-de54367d95a9" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-fa3ff81f-7b33-5955-80fb-a94bca6abd34"] ["question-78eabbdb-ae14-5218-80c9-de54367d95a9" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-e28c09c1-aa3c-5844-9e63-e8909dfcd99f"] [17592186204099 :knowledge-point/questions "question-78eabbdb-ae14-5218-80c9-de54367d95a9"] ["question-5bd6ce37-dfc0-53de-b48f-f0c1cbf86c1e" :question/id #uuid "5bd6ce37-dfc0-53de-b48f-f0c1cbf86c1e"] ["question-5bd6ce37-dfc0-53de-b48f-f0c1cbf86c1e" :question/math-academy-id "q-269782"] ["question-5bd6ce37-dfc0-53de-b48f-f0c1cbf86c1e" :question/problem "Consider the functions $y:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ and $f:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2},$ defined by\n\n$$\ny(x)=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{2}+{x}_{2}^{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}^{2}-{x}_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}],\\,f(y)=[\\begin{aligned}2{y}_{1}+4{y}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{1}^{2}+8{y}_{2}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat is \n$\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}f(y(x))$ evaluated at \n${x}_{0}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]?$\n\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"70px\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"30px\">\n${\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}f(y(x))|}_{{x}_{0}}=\\,\\,$\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">$20$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>"] ["question-5bd6ce37-dfc0-53de-b48f-f0c1cbf86c1e" :question/worked-solution "Using the chain rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}f(y(x))=\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\nLet's consider each of the factors in turn.\n\n- The function $f$ acts on a vector $y\\in {R}^{2}$ and outputs a vector $f(y)\\in {R}^{2}.$ Thus, the total derivative of $f$ with respect to $y$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}y} & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂{f}_{1}}{∂{y}_{1}} & \\frac{∂{f}_{1}}{∂{y}_{2}} \\\\ \\frac{∂{f}_{2}}{∂{y}_{1}} & \\frac{∂{f}_{2}}{∂{y}_{2}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂{y}_{1}}(2{y}_{1}+4{y}_{2}) & \\frac{∂}{∂{y}_{2}}(2{y}_{1}+4{y}_{2}) \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂{y}_{1}}({y}_{1}^{2}+8{y}_{2}) & \\frac{∂}{∂{y}_{2}}({y}_{1}^{2}+8{y}_{2})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 \\\\ 2{y}_{1} & 8\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at ${y}_{0}=y({x}_{0})=[\\begin{aligned}{1}^{2}+{0}^{2} \\\\ {1}^{2}-{0}^{2}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],$ we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}y}{|}_{{y}_{0}}=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 8\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n- The function $y$ acts on a vector $x\\in {R}^{2}$ and outputs a vector $y(x)\\in {R}^{2}.$ Thus, the total derivative of $y$ with respect to $x$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂{y}_{1}}{∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{∂{y}_{1}}{∂{x}_{2}} \\\\ \\frac{∂{y}_{2}}{∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{∂{y}_{2}}{∂{x}_{2}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂{x}_{1}}({x}_{1}^{2}+{x}_{2}^{2}) & \\frac{∂}{∂{x}_{2}}({x}_{1}^{2}+{x}_{2}^{2}) \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂{x}_{1}}({x}_{1}^{2}-{x}_{2}^{2}) & \\frac{∂}{∂{x}_{2}}({x}_{1}^{2}-{x}_{2}^{2})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1} & 2{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1} & -2{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at ${x}_{0}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],$ we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}{|}_{{x}_{0}}=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}f(y(x)){|}_{{x}_{0}} & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}y}{|}_{{y}_{0}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}{|}_{{x}_{0}} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 8\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}12 & 0 \\\\ 20 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-5bd6ce37-dfc0-53de-b48f-f0c1cbf86c1e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-4bc9ae22-cb20-510a-b7a2-e6f0d1758238" :answer-field/id #uuid "4bc9ae22-cb20-510a-b7a2-e6f0d1758238"] ["answer-d386f327-1b96-53b3-a7e0-f538b69b4b60" :answer/id #uuid "d386f327-1b96-53b3-a7e0-f538b69b4b60"] ["answer-d386f327-1b96-53b3-a7e0-f538b69b4b60" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d386f327-1b96-53b3-a7e0-f538b69b4b60" :answer/value "12"] ["answer-field-4bc9ae22-cb20-510a-b7a2-e6f0d1758238" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-4bc9ae22-cb20-510a-b7a2-e6f0d1758238" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-4bc9ae22-cb20-510a-b7a2-e6f0d1758238" :answer-field/correct "answer-d386f327-1b96-53b3-a7e0-f538b69b4b60"] ["answer-field-4bc9ae22-cb20-510a-b7a2-e6f0d1758238" :answer-field/choices "answer-d386f327-1b96-53b3-a7e0-f538b69b4b60"] ["answer-field-942c7780-6535-5d0f-a664-a1bcb891c110" :answer-field/id #uuid "942c7780-6535-5d0f-a664-a1bcb891c110"] ["answer-23ed8eaa-ca9f-556c-8ad7-26b7d0de8dab" :answer/id #uuid "23ed8eaa-ca9f-556c-8ad7-26b7d0de8dab"] ["answer-23ed8eaa-ca9f-556c-8ad7-26b7d0de8dab" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-23ed8eaa-ca9f-556c-8ad7-26b7d0de8dab" :answer/value "0"] ["answer-field-942c7780-6535-5d0f-a664-a1bcb891c110" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-942c7780-6535-5d0f-a664-a1bcb891c110" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-942c7780-6535-5d0f-a664-a1bcb891c110" :answer-field/correct "answer-23ed8eaa-ca9f-55