ing at ${y}_{0}=A{x}_{0}=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}],$ we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}y}{|}_{{y}_{0}}=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n- The function $y$ acts on a vector $x\\in {R}^{2}$ by multiplying it by $A$ and outputs a vector $y(x)\\in {R}^{2}.$ Thus,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=A.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}f(z(y(x))){|}_{{x}_{0}} & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}z}{|}_{{z}_{0}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}y}{|}_{{y}_{0}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}{|}_{{x}_{0}} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}10 & 0 \\\\ 8 & -4\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}20 & 30 \\\\ 20 & 8\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-84a8217d-9b8f-5f74-ba0c-1dc1b7379e21" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-fd196ff8-da06-5ece-8bd7-2692100d1ca4" :answer-field/id #uuid "fd196ff8-da06-5ece-8bd7-2692100d1ca4"] ["answer-1a94cb7e-93fa-5ae6-867e-dd055216d295" :answer/id #uuid "1a94cb7e-93fa-5ae6-867e-dd055216d295"] ["answer-1a94cb7e-93fa-5ae6-867e-dd055216d295" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-1a94cb7e-93fa-5ae6-867e-dd055216d295" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}10 & 20 \\\\ 20 & 8\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-4e5f0dcf-acb7-567f-b3d0-d286714d4078" :answer/id #uuid "4e5f0dcf-acb7-567f-b3d0-d286714d4078"] ["answer-4e5f0dcf-acb7-567f-b3d0-d286714d4078" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4e5f0dcf-acb7-567f-b3d0-d286714d4078" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 30 \\\\ 20 & 8\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-b72d5e70-4fb9-584a-8ad9-758dba2d99ac" :answer/id #uuid "b72d5e70-4fb9-584a-8ad9-758dba2d99ac"] ["answer-b72d5e70-4fb9-584a-8